    "lawCode": "Amd Part H1 §4, Chap 62 of 2003",
    "lawSection": "Public Services",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S6794\n\nTITLE OF BILL:\nAn act\nto amend chapter 62 of the laws of 2003, amending the public service law\nrelating to establishing the New York telecommunications relay service\ncenter, in relation to making permanent provisions of law establishing\nsuch center\n\nPURPOSE:\nThis will make permanent provisions of law establishing the New York\ntelecommunications relay service center.\n\nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\nSection One - Section 1 -- Amends section 4 of part H1 of\nchapter 6201 of the laws of 2003. It makes the provisions permanent.\n\nSection Two - Establishes the effective date.\n\nJUSTIFICATION:\nPublic Service Law section 92-a(2)(a) requires that the New York\nTelecommunications Relay Service Center be located In Syracuse, New\nYork. This provision expires on June 1, 2013. This legislation seeks\nto extend this provision making it permanent.\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\nNew Bill.\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\nNone.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n\n",
